# 全局：文本文件一律 LF（含 checkout），杜绝 CRLF 进入仓库/部署产物。
# 历史：按扩展名白名单（*.sh/*.py 等）没覆盖 .go/.ts/.vue/.json，GPT/Windows
# 侧带来的 CRLF 源文件曾导致容器脚本 exit 127、构建行尾漂移——2026-09-09 十八轮
# 改为全局规则 + git add --renormalize 一次性归一。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 显式二进制（text=auto 通常能自动识别，这里声明防止误判）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.der binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.wasm binary
